Package: pedplot
Title: Flexible Pedigree Plotting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", , "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: A fresh approach to pedigree plotting, offering improved
    alignments and detailed annotation options. Lineage plots can be
    formed by hiding selected founders. 'pedplot' is part of the
    'pedsuite' ecosystem for pedigree analysis in R.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/magnusdv/pedplot
